direction: down

Available Compute -> PID
PID: PID Controller
PID -> Base Quota: 输出 base quota

Base Quota -> Allocation

Allocation: {
  label: Value-aware Allocation (Differentiated QoS)
  style.stroke: "#2563eb"
  direction: right
  
  Low: user_value = 0.5\n(Lower Quota) {
    style.stroke: "#f59e0b"
  }
  
  Normal: user_value = 1.0\n(Base Quota) {
    style.stroke: "#16a34a"
  }
  
  High: user_value = 1.5\n(Higher Quota) {
    style.stroke: "#dc2626"
  }
}
